		"Id": "mechdef_thunderbolt_TDR-5T",
		"Name": "Thunderbolt",
		"Details": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Taurian Concordat ended up with the lion's share of the Heavy Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Thunderbolt TDR-5T. This refit of the venerable TDR-5S swaps the Large Laser for a Heavy Plasma Rifle with two tons of ammunition, the SRM-2 for an SRM-4, and the Machine Guns for two ER Flamers. The tonnage for these weapon upgrades is found with the addition of an XL engine and a switch to Double Heat Sinks (14 in total). The LRM-15 and brace of Medium Lasers are retained from the TDR-5S.",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_thunderbolt"
	},
